### Testing the service locally
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/MyService/tyson(name='Simon')

###Service Document
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService

###Expose Metadata
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/$metadata 

### Read all Employee data
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/EmployeeSet
Authorization: Basic tyson:Welcome1

###Selected columns
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/EmployeeSet?$select=ID,nameFirst,nameLast,sex,email

###Count the records
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/EmployeeSet/$count

###pagination 
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/EmployeeSet?$top=2&$skip=2

###Select a single employee
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/EmployeeSet/02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C197E7FB

###Filter based on condition
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=bankName eq 'My Bank of San Francisco'&$top=2

###Pattern Match 
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=contains(nameFirst,'Su')

###Sorting the employee
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/EmployeeSet?$orderby=salaryAmount desc&$top=5

###Load all the Purchaseorder
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/PurchaseOrderSet

###Get single Purchaseorder
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/PurchaseOrderSet/74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B0C98DC2C052

###Load the Item data for the corresponding PO
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/PurchaseOrderSet/74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B0C98DC2C052/Items

###Load the PO alsong with items data also
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/PurchaseOrderSet/74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B0C98DC2C052?$expand=Items

###Using CDS View we do Lazy Loading
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CDSService/ProductSet/74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B06B26EB6052?$expand=To_Items

###OData V4 allows Filtering Child data also
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CDSService/ProductSet/74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B06B26EB6052?$expand=To_Items($filter=TaxAmount le 300)

###Create operation to insert data into database
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatelogService/EmployeeSet
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic simon:Welcome2

{
  "nameFirst": "Tyson",
  "nameMiddle": "KuttynaaiJulie",
  "nameLast": "Simon",
  "nameInitials": null,
  "sex": "M",
  "language": "E",
  "phoneNumber": null,
  "email": "tyson.simon@itelo.info",
  "loginName": "TYSSIM",
  "Currency_code": "USD",
  "salaryAmount": 60000,
  "accountNumber": "7766554433",
  "bankId": "121000",
  "bankName": "My Bank of Baroda"
}

